  refine boxCert_of_parts (Arb4.BandGlue_h7000.seg 0) E0 (Arb4.BandGlue_h7000.seg_edge 0 (by norm_num)).1
    (Arb4.BandGlue_h7000.seg_edge 0 (by norm_num)).2 (valid_of_B _ _ _ _ _ E0 hT0 hT1 hcc hR hc.1)
    (Arb4.BandGlue_h7000.seg_geom 0 (by norm_num)) ?_ ?_ ?_ (k6side_of_B _ G_T6000 G_T6038 E0 hT0 hT1 hc.2) ?_ ?_
